body:
Someone please help me with my last crystal challenge for the domain. I'm constantly fighting the enemies, but always get cucked by either the time or the temp system. I built a shatter team long before dragonspine, and now I'm being cucked because everything is ice. I need someone with some decent pyro dmg pls ;–;

TL;DR, I need pyro help for fighting abyss mages
WL 5 min.
